            "image": "shopify://shop_images/banner1.webp",
            "heading": "Hotels <mark>with instant</mark> online booking",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "text": "<p><a href=\"https://www.gutscheinreisen24.de/check-hotels\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gutscheinreisen24.de/check-hotels\"><strong>50,000+ Hotels Available</strong></a><strong><br/></strong>Enjoy instant access to a worldwide hotel selection with direct booking options.</p><h4>How It Works</h4><p><strong>1. Register Your Membership Code</strong><br/>Receive your personal Membership Code and register it once on our booking platform.</p><p><strong>2. Search Your Preferred Hotel</strong><br/>Browse through more than <strong>50,000 hotels worldwide</strong> and find your ideal stay.</p><p><strong>3. Enter Your Travel Details</strong><br/>Simply provide:</p><ul><li>Destination</li><li>Travel dates</li><li>Number of guests</li></ul><p><strong>4. View Available Hotels</strong><br/>The system will instantly display available hotels based on your preferences.</p><p><strong>5. Book Instantly & Enjoy Your Stay</strong><br/>Choose your preferred hotel and complete your booking directly through the platform.</p><p><a href=\"https://Gutscheinreisen24.de\" title=\"https://Gutscheinreisen24.de\"><em>Search & Book Hotels</em></a></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/logo_5_069021ae-4290-4756-a3be-75256f460e3c.png"
          }
        },
        "collection_aP6jca": {
          "type": "collection",
          "settings": {
            "collection": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/banner1.webp",
            "heading": "Hotels <mark>requiring advance</mark>booking",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "text": "<p><a href=\"https://www.gutscheinreisen24.de/hoteluebersicht.html\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gutscheinreisen24.de/hoteluebersicht.html\"><strong>1,700+ Hotels Available</strong></a><strong><br/></strong>Choose from our exclusive hotel selection and request your preferred stay.</p><h4>How it works:</h4><p><strong>01 — Register Your Membership Code</strong><br/>Enter your Membership Code on our booking platform.</p><p><strong>02 — Choose Your Hotel</strong><br/>Browse the \"Hotels with Advance Booking\" collection and select your preferred hotel.</p><p><strong>03 — Request Your Booking</strong><br/>Submit your preferred travel dates and booking request online.</p><p><strong>04 — Availability Confirmation</strong><br/>We contact the hotel to confirm availability.</p><p><strong>05 — Enjoy Your Stay</strong><br/>Receive your booking confirmation and present it at the hotel upon arrival.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://Gutscheinreisen24.de\" title=\"https://Gutscheinreisen24.de\"><em>Search & Book Hotels</em></a></p>",
